{"about_the_game":"In a world ravaged by Kaijus, the Kaiju cracking Company came into being. As the boss of the company, you will lead a professional team to deal with Kaiju corpses, obtain precious resources, and expand the business territory.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/1y.png?t=1743005675\" /><br>After defeating the Kaiju, organize a team to decompose it and obtain rare materials. Formulate a reasonable decomposition strategy to maximize resource utilization.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/1.gif?t=1743005675\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/2y.png?t=1743005675\" /><br>Recruit various professional talents to form an efficient team. Different employees have unique skills, and reasonable matching can improve the company's operating efficiency. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/2.gif?t=1743005675\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/3y.png?t=1743005675\" /><br>Buy and sell decomposition materials in a dynamic market. Grasp the market situation, invest, and obtain huge profits.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/3.gif?t=1743005675\" /><br><br><br>In addition, the game also provides a variety of gameplay such as research and development and upgrading, fighting Kaijus, and acquiring city assets, waiting for you to explore.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586410?t=1743005675","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586410?t=1743005675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akama